          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.48,
          "end": 52.98,
          "en": "I will add a new folder, Meals List.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.98,
          "end": 55.01,
          "en": "Sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.01,
          "end": 57.26,
          "en": "And I will move the meal item into this folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.26,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "because we only use that meal item in a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 62.66,
          "en": "and I will add a new file in there as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.66,
          "end": 65.333,
          "en": "which is the Meals ListJS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.28,
          "end": 69.34,
          "en": "And in that file I will add a new Functional Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.34,
          "end": 73.49,
          "en": "the Meals List Component like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.49,
          "end": 76.783,
          "en": "which also of course is exported like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78,
          "end": 79.57,
