        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.6,
          "end": 149.29,
          "en": "and I'm using object destructuring here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.29,
          "end": 152.07,
          "en": "to pull out a prop named, Items.",
