        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.59,
          "end": 273.363,
          "en": "to get our Favorite Meals context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 274.69,
          "end": 279.25,
          "en": "and then we get our actual Favorite Meals which we need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 279.25,
          "end": 281.5,
          "en": "by using our meals raw data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 281.5,
          "end": 284.773,
          "en": "imported from that dummy data file in the data folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.97,
          "end": 288.04,
          "en": "and here we now need to select all the meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 288.04,
          "end": 291.26,
          "en": "that are part of our Favorites Meal context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 291.26,
          "end": 293.54,
          "en": "or to be precise of the IDs array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 293.54,
          "end": 295.95,
          "en": "that we manage in that context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 298.58,
          "en": "So we need to get all the meals in the raw data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 298.58,
          "end": 301.93,
          "en": "that have an ID that's part of this IDs array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 301.93,
          "end": 303.753,
          "en": "that we manage in our context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 304.71,
          "end": 306.65,
          "en": "This is fairly easy to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 306.65,
          "end": 308.78,
          "en": "we can use the filter method again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 308.78,
          "end": 312.01,
          "en": "to filter out all the meals from the raw data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 312.01,
          "end": 313.46,
          "en": "that have a fitting ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 313.46,
          "end": 316.36,
          "en": "So we look at all the IDs of all the meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 316.36,
          "end": 319.05,
          "en": "and if an ID is equal to an ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 319.05,
          "end": 322,
          "en": "that's part of our Favorite Meals IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 322,
          "end": 323.75,
          "en": "we wanna keep it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 323.75,
          "end": 326.65,
          "en": "So therefore the actual logic here should be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 326.65,
          "end": 330.14,
          "en": "that we use our Favorite Meals context IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 330.14,
          "end": 331.623,
          "en": "so this array of IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 332.75,
          "end": 335.03,
          "en": "and we use the includes method there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 335.03,
          "end": 339.01,
          "en": "to see whether a given meal ID is included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 339.01,
          "end": 341.31,
          "en": "So we take a look at all the meals in the raw data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 341.31,
          "end": 343.01,
          "en": "and if the ID of a meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 343.01,
          "end": 346.17,
          "en": "is included in our Favorite Meal IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 346.17,
          "end": 349.84000000000003,
          "en": "we return true, and therefore the Item will be kept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 349.84000000000003,
          "end": 353.97,
          "en": "in the newly created array that is returned by filter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 353.97,
          "end": 356.061,
          "en": "So filter will return an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 356.061,
          "end": 358.82,
          "en": "with all the meals that have an entry",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 358.82,
          "end": 361.323,
          "en": "in our IDs array in our context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 362.23,
          "end": 363.49,
          "en": "And therefore then we can pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 363.49,
          "end": 366.203,
          "en": "our Favorite Meals to Items, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 368.62,
          "end": 373.26,
          "en": "And with that done if we now go to another meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 373.26,
          "end": 377.44,
          "en": "and favorite this meal, and favorite this meal let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 377.44,
          "end": 379.513,
          "en": "and we then go to the Favorites screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 380.51,
          "end": 383.02,
          "en": "we see these two meals there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
